type: software
title: "have-we-been-nuked"
abstract: "Answers the important question using real, live EPA RadNet radiation data. Sweeps gamma monitors across the US and compares each station's latest reading to its own statistical baseline. A joke — but with real anomaly detection, stale-monitor warnings, and exit codes for your cron-job doomsday needs."
